Het IRIW-gcgc-gpu-relaxed
"Heterogeneous IRIW-gcgc-gpu-relaxed: per-proc device assignment gpu,cpu,gpu,cpu (cpu=AArch64, gpu=LISA/PTX)"
{
1:X2=y;
3:X0=x;
}
 P0:gpu              | P1:cpu      | P2:gpu              | P3:cpu      ;
 r[relaxed,gpu] r0 x | MOV W1,#1   | r[relaxed,gpu] r0 y | MOV W1,#1   ;
 r[relaxed,gpu] r1 y | STR W1,[X2] | r[relaxed,gpu] r1 x | STR W1,[X0] ;
exists (0:r0=1 /\ 0:r1=0 /\ 2:r0=1 /\ 2:r1=0)
